## Hardware Design Files

Hardware design files are released under the CERN Open Hardware Licence
Version 2 - Permissive (`CERN-OHL-P-2.0`).

Copyright (c) 2026 Pierre Jay

This includes:

- `eda/sonnette.epro`
- `eda/sonnette_sch.pdf`
- hardware design exports derived from the EasyEDA project

Full text:
https://ohwr.org/cern_ohl_p_v2.txt

## Board Support Files

Device tree files in `bsp/` keep their SPDX license headers:

- `GPL-2.0-or-later OR MIT`

Other project-authored BSP integration/config files in `bsp/` are
released under the MIT License unless an individual file header says
otherwise.

The Luckfox/Rockchip SDK itself is not included in this repository and
remains under its own upstream licenses.

## Third-Party Software

This repository contains build instructions for pjproject/PJSIP but does
not include or relicense pjproject itself. If you redistribute binaries or
firmware images containing pjsua, comply with pjproject/PJSIP licensing.

The Luckfox/Rockchip SDK, Linux kernel, U-Boot, Buildroot packages,
firmware blobs and toolchains remain under their respective upstream
licenses.

## Audio Asset

`deploy/dingdong.wav` is adapted from a sound obtained from
LaSonotheque.org.

LaSonotheque states that sounds marked "Gratuit et Libre de droits" may
be copied, adapted and used, including commercially, without asking for
permission:
https://lasonotheque.org/licences.html

Credit is appreciated by LaSonotheque but not required. Suggested credit:

"Sound adapted from LaSonotheque.org / Joseph Sardin."
